{
  "meta": {
    "package": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC_INT.pcc",
    "stem": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC",
    "textLang": "INT",
    "sets": 1
  },
  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89968",
      "en": "It is difficult to explain. She is many things to many people, and something different for each.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89969",
      "en": "Some seek her for advice, some for entertainment, others still for pleasure.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89970",
      "en": "Most of the time, our clients won't realize what they were seeking until after she has provided it for them.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89971",
      "en": "No, not in the usual sense. She is merely a woman. A woman with remarkable compassion and a generous spirit.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89972",
      "en": "I suggest you make an appointment and see for yourself.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89973",
      "en": "I am one of the Consort's acolytes.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89974",
      "en": "Many of the people here today will not see the Consort, but they expect to be attended to just the same.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89975",
      "en": "Well, each acolyte has her unique abilities. Some soothe with song, others with conversation.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89976",
      "en": "As much as possible we seek to match the needs of our clients to the skills of our acolytes.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89977",
      "en": "My specialty is touch. My fingertips can find every tension point in your body... and relieve it.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89979",
      "en": "Aw. Well, I hope that you will return again in the future, we always enjoy seeing new clients.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89981",
      "en": "Huh. It appears the Consort has taken notice of you. She'd like to meet with you now.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89982",
      "en": "Just head upstairs. She will be waiting for you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89983",
      "en": "I don't know. You'll have to ask her yourself.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89984",
      "en": "Well, don't wait too long. I wouldn't want you to miss this opportunity.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89985",
      "en": "She will be waiting upstairs, if you choose to go.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89987",
      "en": "Of course. Come back any time.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89988",
      "en": "I'm sorry, Commander, but I have been instructed not to offer you our services.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89989",
      "en": "Septimus has gotten worse. The Consort is very disappointed you could not help him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89991",
      "en": "I am afraid you are no longer eligible for our services, Commander. Good day.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89992",
      "en": "It is unfortunate that you decided not to aid the Consort.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89994",
      "en": "Hello again, Commander.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89995",
      "en": "Hello again. The Consort is very pleased with everything that you have done for her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89997",
      "en": "The Consort is waiting to speak with you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89998",
      "en": "Septimus has sent word. Apparently, he has sought the Consort's forgiveness.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|89999",
      "en": "Few are ever asked to aid Sha'ira. It's quite an honor.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90000",
      "en": "He's been seeing the Consort for longer than I can remember.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90002",
      "en": "He was always very respectful to the acolytes. Very... noble.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90004",
      "en": "The Consort still awaits your visit.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90005",
      "en": "Go upstairs and speak with the Consort.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90006",
      "en": "Welcome. I am Nelyna. I don't recognize you as one of our expected clients today.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90007",
      "en": "Would you like me to see when the Consort will be able to meet with you?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90008",
      "en": "Mm, I'm afraid not. Yeah, you must understand, there are many who seek the Consort's services.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90009",
      "en": "But if you wish to leave your name, she'll make every effort to meet with you.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90010",
      "en": "Excellent. You should hear something in... hmm, three or four months.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90011",
      "en": "Well, that's not for me to judge. I have your name and you'll be contacted. Is there anything else?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90017",
      "en": "What do you know about the General?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90022",
      "en": "Can't I just go in?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90024",
      "en": "Commander Shepard. I'm with the Spectres.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90025",
      "en": "Commander Shepard. With the Alliance Navy.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90026",
      "en": "Nobody's worth that much of a wait.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90027",
      "en": "What is the Consort? What does she do?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90030",
      "en": "You make her sound like some kind of oracle.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90032",
      "en": "What do you do here, Nelyna?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90034",
      "en": "What exactly do you attend to?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90037",
      "en": "I think I'm done here.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90041",
      "en": "Where do I go?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90042",
      "en": "What does she want to see me for?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90043",
      "en": "If I have time I'll speak with her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90051",
      "en": "Septimus",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90056",
      "en": "I need an appointment?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90057",
      "en": "Consort",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90058",
      "en": "Personal questions",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90059",
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90061",
      "en": "All right.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90062",
      "en": "All right.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90063",
      "en": "No, thanks.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90064",
      "en": "Are you serious?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90065",
      "en": "No, thanks.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90068",
      "en": "Is she mystical?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90071",
      "en": "How?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90077",
      "en": "Sure.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90078",
      "en": "Why?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90079",
      "en": "Maybe later.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|90206",
      "en": "Hello again. I am afraid I still do not have you down on our client list.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|104446",
      "en": "It is our job to ensure that they leave contented.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|104447",
      "en": "Nelyna.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|104448",
      "en": "Yes, Sha'ira?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|104449",
      "en": "Send the Commander up to see me. I wish to speak with him.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|104450",
      "en": "Send the Commander up to see me. I wish to speak with her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|104451",
      "en": "Yes. Of course, mistress.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|104452",
      "en": "Then one day, he stormed out of here, furious. He hasn't been back since.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|111882",
      "en": "Excellent. I will add you to our client list. We should be able to see you in... hmm, three or four months.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|111883",
      "en": "Yeah, she is grateful for your assistance. However, you have already been rewarded for helping her.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|111884",
      "en": "The client list is a separate matter, and her schedule is completely booked for the next several months.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|111886",
      "en": "Any chance I can move up on her client list? I did help her out.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|111888",
      "en": "I'd like to try out your services.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|111889",
      "en": "Can I get an appointment now?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|111893",
      "en": "Sounds interesting.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|145103",
      "en": "I should go.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|145104",
      "en": "I should go.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|145105",
      "en": "Not interested.",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|145114",
      "en": "Are you serious?",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|145115",
      "en": "Forget it!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|157619",
      "en": "Forget it!",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|163135",
      "en": "Septimus",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|163136",
      "en": "Septimus",
      "tr": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "BIOA_STA20_04C_DSG_LOC|sta20_asari_employee03_D|163137",
      "en": "Septimus",
      "tr": ""
